{'symbol': 'IVZ', 'date': '2021-06-23 16:15:00', 'title': 'INVESCO MORTGAGE CAPITAL INC. ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY COMMON DIVIDEND', 'text': 'ATLANTA, JUNE 23, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- INVESCO MORTGAGE CAPITAL INC. (THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: IVR) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND ON SHARES OF ITS COMMON STOCK. COMMON STOCK DIVIDEND THE COMPANY\'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.09 PER SHARE OF COMMON STOCK FOR THE SECOND QUARTER OF 2021.'}